OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey's 2026 Make a Difference
OL,4,Afinalists named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four finalists for the 2026 BBC
OL,7,FRadio Guernsey Make a Difference Awards
OL,8,Fhave been revealed.
OL,10,FThe annual awards highlight the
OL,11,Fdifferent ways individuals and groups
OL,12,Fare helping in the community.
OL,14,FThe finalists are: eight-year-old
OL,15,FAlderney fundraiser Benji, boxing
OL,16,Fdevelopment officer Mandy Hobart,
OL,17,Frubbish collecting "wombler" Sarah
OL,18,FWarr, and founders of a local money
OL,19,Fsaving website Kat Gillespie and Sarah
OL,20,Fde Carteret.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
